"The training knobs below are declared here as a contract (so the "
"framework can always read ``rc.model.epochs`` / ``rc.model.batch_size`` /"
" etc.); subclasses override the defaults with model-specific values and "
"may carry an ``optuna`` field-metadata key consumed by the Optuna search-"
"space derive."

